  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 502.08 Capitalization grant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 502.08 “Capitalization grant” means funds made available to the state by the federal government for use in the CWSRF program in accordance with:\n\n(a) Title VI of the federal CWA, 33 U.S.C. §§1381-1387; or\n\n(b) Any other federal initiative.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22 (formerly Env-Wq 502.07)",
